					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It's weird, I've never been that interested in the other recurring characters throughout the site. I don't mean that as a slur against people who write those characters, but it's just never done it for me. Lombardi, on the other hand&#8230;I love it. I love <em>him</em>. Something about the way he's written makes him seem far more like a real person, who's really saying these words to me (in a Cockney accent, for some reason.)</p> <p>+1, so very very hard.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
