					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It'd ruin it <em>so much</em>, but Lombardi has concretized so much of how I see Foundation Agents that I want to write my character saving him.</p> <p>I won't, but it's <em>so damned tempting</em>. Lombardi! Must! Live!</p> <p>Hell: make it a writing project. Everyone writes a story explaining how Lombardi gets out. There's no canon, so who's to say that moments after sending this, Lombardi is shown that no Agent of the Foundation is ever alone?!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
